  "stem": "What is the solution to the equation \\(x - 2\\sqrt{x} - 8 = 0\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "16"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Let \\(u = \\sqrt{x}\\), so \\(x = u^{2}\\): \\(u^{2} - 2u - 8 = 0\\), which factors as \\((u - 4)(u + 2) = 0\\).",
    "A square root cannot be negative, so \\(u = 4\\) and \\(x = 16\\).",
    "Check: \\(16 - 2(4) - 8 = 0\\)."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
  "traps": null,
  "verify": "x = symbols('x', nonnegative=True)\nsol = solve(Eq(x - 2*sqrt(x) - 8, 0), x)\nassert sol == [16]\nassert [Rational(s) for s in spr_answers] == sol",
